{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chess Texas</strong> is a tactical adventure set in the Wild West, where every duel is settled on the chessboard. Travel from dusty saloons to desert outposts, challenging bandits, bosses, and townsfolk to strategic battles in a handcrafted open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each town hides its own Chess Hall, run by a tough opponent with a unique puzzle theme. Outthink, outplay, and outlast them to earn your place in the final showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore, talk, challenge, and conquer\u2014this ain't just chess, it's <i>Chess Texas</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wild West Adventure</strong> \u2013 Roam across towns, camps, and routes in a stylized cowboy setting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/bd2bfa8da4abdd66731cdb787a5de2a9.avif?t=1752113488\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Face off in themed chess puzzles against powerful Chess Hall leaders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/2f1f0bf3c8b7bc5c8e96d156f8e74a19.avif?t=1752113488\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story and Characters</strong> \u2013 Meet quirky NPCs, uncover secrets, and piece together the legends of Chess Texas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/42340371db600884dd259ed3b00e127e.avif?t=1752113488\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic Variety</strong> \u2013 From classic matches to Fischer Random and bait-focused AIs, each match tests a different skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/bd6dcbb968731c7097ccbe76b7158c39.avif?t=1752113488\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Items and Exploration</strong> \u2013 Discover tools, clues, and advantages in the overworld that help during chess battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/extras/e5fe4c2797aa822e9cb49ce5cfc45780.avif?t=1752113488\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saddle up and bring your brain. It's time to take the West, one board at a time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3826950?t=1752113488","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/1939c6329491164e560b9f5d1f51faec8ea9b7c3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752113488","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/1ce94febab2be581718f729d3ee6d6bbbd075e7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752113488","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826950/1ce94febab2be581718f729d3ee6d6bbbd075e7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752113488","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chess Texas</strong> is a tactical adventure set in the Wild West, where every duel is settled on the chessboard. Travel from dusty saloons to desert outposts, challenging bandits, bosses, and townsfolk to strategic battles in a handcrafte